# The agent-index usage client, pinned.
#
# Not committed: plow-pbc/agent-index-client owns that file, so this repo names
# a commit instead of carrying a copy that drifts from it. The image build
# fetches exactly this revision and refuses anything else.
#
# A sha, never `main`. Same reason the Dockerfile pins its base by digest: a
# moving reference substitutes unreviewed code under an agent that holds a live
# credential. Bumping this is an edit somebody reviews.
#
# The checksum is the second half of that. A sha in a URL is only as good as
# the host serving it, and this file is executed inside the agent.
#
# Verified by download: this sha256 is the hash of that revision's file.
